plank-player (5.27.80+git20261005.f87e775-1+stereo3d4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Depend on the desktop QML style required to open the window, and on
    qml6-module-qtmultimedia (>= 6.11.2-3+stereo3d15~).
  * Remember input packing and eye swap per file in PlankPlayer's settings,
    without modifying media. Report settings failures in nine languages.

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:00:00 +0000

plank-player (5.27.80+git20261005.f87e775-1+stereo3d3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show the person when the desktop refuses to show a 3D video in 3D: Qt
    Multimedia's Video (+stereo3d15) draws the ordinary picture and says why in
    stereoLayerFailure; Plank Player shows that reason over the video, with the
    sentence in nine languages. The stereo drawing, the declaration and the
    failure stay Qt Multimedia's.
  * The 3D menu offers Swap Eyes only for a video shown in 3D (the correction
    is not offered on 2D content).
  * Depend on libqt6multimedia6 and qml6-module-qtmultimedia
    (>= 6.11.2-3+stereo3d15~).

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 19:30:00 -0300

plank-player (5.27.80+git20261005.f87e775-1+stereo3d2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The 3D menu is bound to the stereo properties of Qt Multimedia's Video
    (stereoView, stereoInput, stereoSwapEyes, stereoShapeFallback): Plank
    Player's own stereo filter and stereo layer (about 730 lines of C++) are
    gone, Qt Multimedia's VideoOutput takes the views of a 3D video apart and
    shows them to the compositor as stereo content (edition) or shows one
    view; the on-screen display and the menus stay the window's own surface.
  * Keep the Return key fix (play/pause paused and resumed at once).
  * Depend on libqt6multimedia6 and qml6-module-qtmultimedia
    (>= 6.11.2-3+stereo3d3~); no longer on libstereo-declare1.

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 20:00:00 -0300

plank-player (5.27.80+git20261005.f87e775-1+stereo3d1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show a stereoscopic 3D video to both eyes: Qt Multimedia's stereo mode of
    the frames read by a StereoFilter of Plank Player's own, a layer under the
    window declared as full side by side, and a 3D menu (superseded by
    +stereo3d2).

